    <meta http-equiv="description" content="Chelsea Senior Living owns and operates 10 senior living communities in New Jersey and 3 senior living communities in New York. These NJ/NY retirement communities offer assisted living, independent living, memory care, respite, and behavioral health services with NJ locations in Warren County, Morris County, Somerset County, Union County, Middlesex County, Monmouth County, and Ocean County. Chelsea has NY senior living communities in New York and Nassau County." />
    
